## Why This Is Asked

This question evaluates practical rate-limiting design for multi-tenant LLM gateways, focusing on fairness, latency guarantees, and graceful degradation under burst conditions.

## Key Concepts

- Per-tenant quotas with burst handling capabilities
- SLA enforcement and backpressure mechanisms
